OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowery
OL,6,Flight rain in southern areas gradually
OL,7,Fclearing this evening, leaving a dry
OL,8,Fnight for most. Turning chilly inland
OL,9,Funder clearing skies, with the odd
OL,10,Fmist patch forming. Staying milder and
OL,11,Fbreezier in coastal regions with the
OL,12,Fodd shower possible.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny mist soon clearing
OL,15,Fleaving a dry day for most with
OL,16,Fpleasantly warm sunny spells. A few
OL,17,Fshowers are possible, mainly in the
OL,18,Fnorthwest where it will be rather
OL,19,Fbreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
