OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,6,Fwindier on Sunday with heavy rain
OL,7,Farriving, clearing later. Sunny
OL,8,Fperiods on Monday before wet and windy
OL,9,Fweather returns on Tuesday.
OL,10,FTemperatures remaining above average,
OL,11,Fwarmest on Tuesday.
